{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect THoG is a game about placing gems unto a grid.  When the arrange phase completes, THoGs are scored, and a round-winner declared. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984830/extras/44b2a928380614fd536af5e2da485a47.poster.avif?t=1757437454\" width=368 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984830/extras/44b2a928380614fd536af5e2da485a47.webm?t=1757437454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984830/extras/44b2a928380614fd536af5e2da485a47.mp4?t=1757437454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place in the arrange phase...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984830/extras/ffecf6e91b89d42171a4ffb44e28a772.poster.avif?t=1757437454\" width=368 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984830/extras/ffecf6e91b89d42171a4ffb44e28a772.webm?t=1757437454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984830/extras/ffecf6e91b89d42171a4ffb44e28a772.mp4?t=1757437454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score in the THoG phase...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for perfection in Versus puzzle action, or in Perfect single player modes (such as Forever). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become perfect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984830/extras/a62edaf6b2292867d6e94614e8003fbd.poster.avif?t=1757437454\" width=502 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984830/extras/a62edaf6b2292867d6e94614e8003fbd.webm?t=1757437454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984830/extras/a62edaf6b2292867d6e94614e8003fbd.mp4?t=1757437454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 THoGs: Frog Water, Fire, Cardinal Earth, Jordo the Last, Inscrutable Wizard Glibbyr, and Roadside Duality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unto this perfect grid, the 6 by 6 by 6 space will be filled by alternating gems!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984830/extras/c8ee65089f53aac9f1fb7d45e36f6021.poster.avif?t=1757437454\" width=282 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984830/extras/c8ee65089f53aac9f1fb7d45e36f6021.webm?t=1757437454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984830/extras/c8ee65089f53aac9f1fb7d45e36f6021.mp4?t=1757437454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New interpolation of perfect-imperfection; a big-bang but tiny and not-real! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fifth game by Sam Atlas, music by DL Salo</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2984830?t=1757437454","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2984830?t=1757437454","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984830/739075ce284ea0416a7a170d7f93e2ac67cdb66a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757437454","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984830/739075ce2